From c4471a95d02b2c9cc2ed1354e85f51fd7ab10c81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eddie <edward.alvarado@midnight.foundation>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 19:15:40 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] docs(spec): holds without new states - metadata on
 Booked, Final, Pending and Rejected

Replaces the Pinned coin state and Detached transaction status with a
booking record {transaction?, hold?} on Booked, an outstanding list on
Final (released coins stay available, with a warning), a submitter on
Pending and a reason on Rejected, plus the Rejected -> Confirmed edge for
transactions settled by another party after the wallet gave up on them.
